AI-Productivity-Assistant
An AI-powered workplace assistant that automates 5 core productivity tasks:

Email Generation - context-aware professional emails
Meeting Summarization - transcripts -> summary, decisions, action items
Task Planning - natural language -> structured plan with priorities
Research Assistance - topic -> summarized brief with sources
Chatbot Interaction - general workplace Q&A assistant
Built for the AI Productivity Project Brief.

Features
Prompt-engineered modules (zero-shot, few-shot, chain-of-thought, role-based)
Works with OpenAI, Gemini, or local models
Streamlit UI (no-code friendly) + Python API
Responsible AI guardrails included
Tech Stack
Python 3.10+
Streamlit for UI
OpenAI / Google Generative AI SDKs (optional)
Prompt engineering library: custom templates in /prompts
Quick Start
Clone repo:
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/AI-Productivity-Assistant.git
cd AI-Productivity-Assistant
Install:
pip install -r requirements.txt
Set API key (optional - works with fallback templates):
export OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."
# or
export GEMINI_API_KEY="..."
Run:
streamlit run app.py
Project Structure
AI-Productivity-Assistant/
├── app.py                 # Main Streamlit app
├── modules/               # Core task modules
├── prompts/               # Prompt engineering templates
├── requirements.txt
├── ethical_guidelines.md
└── README.md
Prompt Engineering Showcase
See /prompts/prompt_library.md for examples of:

Role prompting
Few-shot examples
Chain-of-Thought for planning
Structured output prompting (JSON)
